deltablue.mst
# WINARM (P3 D4): sprint_p03_detail.md asks PERF.md's Windows-ARM64 table for
# Mandelbrot alongside these two. The existing Mandelbrot workloads all render
# into a GUI Pixmap and time themselves per frame; this one drives the same
# `Mandelbrot>>escapeAtRe:im:` over a fixed grid, checksum-verified, so it fits
# the harness protocol and is comparable across builds and machines.
mandelbrot.mst
